# NOTICE

`Ngwg-firefly-theme` is an independent Ngwg port of the
[Firefly](https://github.com/CuteLeaf/Firefly) Astro theme, itself based on
[Fuwari](https://github.com/saicaca/fuwari).

The layout, colour system and interaction design are inspired by those
projects. The EJS templates, CSS and JavaScript in this repository are an
original implementation for the Ngwg rendering pipeline, not a copy of the
upstream Astro/Svelte/Starlight sources.

This repository does **not** distribute media assets: the demo wallpapers
(`assets/images/wallpaper/*`), author avatar (`assets/images/avatar.avif`) and
logo (`assets/images/logo/*`) are listed in `.gitignore`. When they are present
in a working copy they are copied verbatim from the Firefly project and remain
